            {
              "id": "e126e337-5228-4e61-ae52-960be9ce4594",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong>Blue Wizard Is About to Die</strong></em> was written by Seth Fingers Flynn Barkan, published by Rusty Immelman Press, January 15, 2004."
            },
            {
              "id": "40b8c547-305a-4248-aeca-5fe41292859b",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "243a3372-a403-4a31-8f53-535d86c52d2b",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>The first collection of poetry about video games ever published, BWIATD takes its readers on a psychotic and hilarious tour through the </em><a href=\"#/arcade\"><em>arcade</em></a><em> and </em><a href=\"#/console\"><em>console</em></a><em> games of the Eighties (and beyond). </em><a href=\"#/humor\"><em>Funny</em></a><em>, approachable, and beautifully illustrated by Warren Wucinich, BWIATD is sure to delight and thrill anyone who enjoys (or has enjoyed) playing video games.</em>"
            },
            {
              "id": "42cf9b9e-cc06-4d2f-90bf-1c62884245d2",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            }
          ]
